, Create, Update, Delete (if WooCommerce is active)":["V\u00fdpis, na\u010dten\u00ed, vytvo\u0159en\u00ed, \u00faprava, smaz\u00e1n\u00ed (pokud je WooCommerce aktivn\u00ed)"],"WooCommerce Orders":["Objedn\u00e1vky WooCommerce"],"List, Get, Create (if WooCommerce is active)":["V\u00fdpis, na\u010dten\u00ed, vytvo\u0159en\u00ed (pokud je WooCommerce aktivn\u00ed)"],"Elementor":["Elementor"],"List Pages, Get Structure, Find Widgets, Update Widget (if Elementor is active)":["V\u00fdpis str\u00e1nek, na\u010dten\u00ed struktury, hled\u00e1n\u00ed widget\u016f, \u00faprava widgetu (pokud je Elementor aktivn\u00ed)"],"Plugins Info":["Informace o pluginech"],"Theme Info":["Informace o \u0161ablon\u011b"],"Users Info":["Informace o u\u017eivatel\u00edch"],"Validity":["Platnost"],"Generate token":["Vygenerovat token"],"New JWT token":["Nov\u00fd JWT token"],"Copied!":["Zkop\u00edrov\u00e1no!"],"This token is shown only once. Copy it now - once you leave this page it cannot be displayed again.":["Tento token se zobraz\u00ed jen jednou. Zkop\u00edrujte si jej hned - jakmile tuto str\u00e1nku opust\u00edte, nelze jej znovu zobrazit."],"No active tokens yet.":["Zat\u00edm \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 aktivn\u00ed tokeny."],"Token ID":["ID tokenu"],"User":["U\u017eivatel"],"Revoke":["Odvolat"],"MCP Server":["MCP server"],"MCP (Model Context Protocol) is an open standard that lets external AI tools talk to this WordPress site. Once enabled, Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf or another MCP client can manage posts, pages, products, media and settings directly. Clients authenticate with a JWT token (see below) and only ever get the operations you allow.":["MCP (Model Context Protocol) je otev\u0159en\u00fd standard, kter\u00fd umo\u017e\u0148uje extern\u00edm AI n\u00e1stroj\u016fm komunikovat s t\u00edmto webem WordPress. Po zapnut\u00ed m\u016f\u017ee Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf nebo jin\u00fd MCP klient p\u0159\u00edmo spravovat p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky, str\u00e1nky, produkty, m\u00e9dia a nastaven\u00ed. Klienti se ov\u011b\u0159uj\u00ed JWT tokenem (viz n\u00ed\u017ee) a dostanou jen ty operace, kter\u00e9 povol\u00edte."],"Status:":["Stav:"],"This toggle lives in the Settings tab (\"Enable MCP (tool calling)\") - it is shown here for reference only.":["Tento p\u0159ep\u00edna\u010d je na kart\u011b Nastaven\u00ed (\u201eZapnout MCP (vol\u00e1n\u00ed n\u00e1stroj\u016f)\u201c) - zde je zobrazen jen pro informaci."],"Registered tools & resources":["Registrovan\u00e9 n\u00e1stroje a zdroje"],"These WordPress REST API endpoints are automatically exposed as MCP tools and resources. Tools let the AI perform actions (CRUD operations). Resources provide read-only context about the site.":["Tyto endpointy WordPress REST API jsou automaticky zp\u0159\u00edstupn\u011bny jako MCP n\u00e1stroje a zdroje. N\u00e1stroje umo\u017e\u0148uj\u00ed AI prov\u00e1d\u011bt akce (operace CRUD). Zdroje poskytuj\u00ed kontext o webu jen pro \u010dten\u00ed."],"Tools":["N\u00e1stroje"],"Tool":["N\u00e1stroj"],"Operations":["Operace"],"Resources":["Zdroje"],"Resource":["Zdroj"],"URI":["URI"],"Resources are read-only - the AI can read them but cannot use them to change data.":["Zdroje jsou jen pro \u010dten\u00ed - AI je m\u016f\u017ee \u010d\u00edst, ale nem\u016f\u017ee jejich pomoc\u00ed m\u011bnit data."],"JWT access tokens":["P\u0159\u00edstupov\u00e9 JWT tokeny"],"To connect an external AI client to the MCP server, generate a JWT (JSON Web Token). Paste it into the AI client's configuration (e.g. the Claude Desktop config). Each token has a limited lifetime and can be revoked at any time.":["Pro p\u0159ipojen\u00ed extern\u00edho AI klienta k MCP serveru vygenerujte JWT (JSON Web Token). Vlo\u017ete jej do konfigurace AI klienta (nap\u0159. do konfigurace Claude Desktop). Ka\u017ed\u00fd token m\u00e1 omezenou platnost a lze jej kdykoli odvolat."],"Usage":["Vyu\u017eit\u00ed"],"Conversations":["Konverzace"],"Handoff":["P\u0159ed\u00e1n\u00ed"],"Knowledge Hub":["Znalostn\u00ed centrum"],"RAG Training":["Tr\u00e9nink RAG"],"Content Creator":["Tvorba obsahu"],"Blog Pilot":["Blog Pilot"],"Internal Chat":["Intern\u00ed chat"],"MCP":["MCP"],"Daily requests (per user)":["Denn\u00ed po\u017eadavky (na u\u017eivatele)"],"A Claude API key is currently set.":["API kl\u00ed\u010d Claude je nastaven."],"No Claude API key set yet.":["API kl\u00ed\u010d Claude zat\u00edm nen\u00ed nastaven."],"An OpenAI API key is currently set.":["API kl\u00ed\u010d OpenAI je nastaven."],"No OpenAI API key set yet.":["API kl\u00ed\u010d OpenAI zat\u00edm nen\u00ed nastaven."],"A DeepSeek API key is currently set.":["API kl\u00ed\u010d DeepSeek je nastaven."],"No DeepSeek API key set yet.":["API kl\u00ed\u010d DeepSeek zat\u00edm nen\u00ed nastaven."],"Period (days)":["Obdob\u00ed (dny)"],"Requests:":["Po\u017eadavky:"],"Input tokens:":["Vstupn\u00ed tokeny:"],"Output tokens:":["V\u00fdstupn\u00ed tokeny:"],"Sessions:":["Relace:"],"No usage recorded for this period.":["Pro toto obdob\u00ed nebylo zaznamen\u00e1no \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 vyu\u017eit\u00ed."],"Feature":["Funkce"],"Input tokens":["Vstupn\u00ed tokeny"],"Output tokens":["V\u00fdstupn\u00ed tokeny"]}}}